  "summary": "postinstall fetches and executes binary from bare IP with TLS verification disabled",
  "details": "The postinstall script downloads a platform-specific tarball from a hardcoded bare IPv4 endpoint (https://218.90.133.98:4443/onecode_tgz/), extracts a binary, chmods it 0755, and hardlinks it as the package's CLI executable. The https.get call sets rejectUnauthorized: false, disabling TLS certificate validation. No hash or signature check is performed on the fetched bytes. The download source is a bare IP address unrelated to any publisher-owned domain, and the fetched binary is executed on the installer's host as part of npm install.",
